  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 49f0461d76f811e448ffa889607b5b80, type: 3}
  m_Name: 0End
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: (Alright, I think I've spoken to everyone.)
    speakerName: 'Detective:'
  - text: Yo, are we gonna eat? It's been awhile.
    speakerName: 'Green:'
  - text: I'm sure the Chef is putting his love and soul into the snacks. It shouldn't
      take much longer.
    speakerName: 'Pink:'
  - text: Well I'm starving!
    speakerName: 'Green:'
  - text: I'm going to check in on the Chef. Maybe I can give the viewers a small
      peek as well.
    speakerName: 'Green:'
  - text: Please don't annoy the Chef.
    speakerName: 'Red:'
  - text: Well too bad Red. Later y'all.
    speakerName: 'Green:'
  - text: (And with that, Green goes into the next car.)
    speakerName: 'Detective:'
  - text: I'm sorry but I must agree with Green, it has been awhile.
    speakerName: 'Purple:'
  - text: At the same time Pink gives a good point, we just need to wait a little
      bit longer.
    speakerName: 'Yellow:'
  - text: I just want this journey to be over.
    speakerName: 'Red:'
  - text: I must admit, I am curious as to why these snacks have taken so long to
      be given out.
    speakerName: 'Detective:'
  - text: (As I'm left wondering about the current situation Green comes back, but
      he's attitude has changed.)
    speakerName: 'Detective:'
  - text: Hey Guys...
    speakerName: 'Green:'
  - text: I think I've found a Dead Body.
    speakerName: 'Green:'
